35,2,1,talk,Servas,,- **Servas**: The hall heater stayed on all January there. No one hesitated to switch it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: The statements show February at 29,400 yen, but August was only 9,100. That swing is huge.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: The rooms without sun need heat much earlier, so the old split really doesn’t fit us now.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"- **May**: The electrician quoted 34,000 yen per room, plus annual checks. That’s a massive upfront cost for us.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: That fixed rate removed the fear of the bill, so people used the heat freely.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: The payment log shows three months were settled late, always after someone questioned the amount.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: The statements show the bills change a lot every month, so a fixed split feels unfair.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Daisuke, did you find out how much time the other house spends on their monthly settle?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,- **Servas**: That freedom is what I miss. We should not let fear of the bill make us cold.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: Those late payments happened right after the arguments. The money stress is definitely poisoning our relationships.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: The sunlight data confirms it. Two rooms are cold much longer, so equal shares are unfair.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Daisuke, please tell us. I need to know if the paperwork is worth the 34,000 yen per room.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,- **Daisuke**: It took forty minutes to log readings and split the shared costs by hand.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,- **Servas**: Forty minutes is nothing. The warmth and peace of mind are worth far more than that small effort.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: Forty minutes a month is manageable, but the late payments show the real cost is the tension it creates.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: So the effort is small, but the fairness is what really matters to me.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"- **May**: Forty minutes is fine, but I still need to know if the upfront cost is worth it before I commit.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"- **Daisuke**: It’s manageable, but I worry about who keeps doing it when it gets complicated.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
