60,3,1,talk,Servas,,- **Servas**: The options are here. I hope one of them lets us stop counting every switch we flip.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: I hope we pick something that stops the arguments before they start.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: I just want the option that feels fair for everyone, so we stop worrying about who pays more.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,- **May**: I need to see which option protects me from that winter spike without a huge upfront fee.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,- **Daisuke**: I just want to know which one stops the monthly work from falling on me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,- **Servas**: Option B seems to offer that peace of mind without the heavy upfront cost of meters.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: Option B feels right. A fixed number means no sudden surprises to argue about, which protects our peace.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: Option B sounds good, but I worry the cold rooms will still feel shortchanged in winter.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"- **May**: Option B protects me from the winter spike without the 34,000 yen upfront cost. I can live with that.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"- **Daisuke**: Option B means one big settle at year-end, not monthly work. That sounds much lighter for me.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,- **Servas**: I agree. A fixed rate lets us live without the constant anxiety of the meter.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: I agree. Predictable numbers mean no more awkward reminders or accusations flying around the kitchen.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: But if the winter bill is much higher, won’t the year-end settle still feel unfair to the cold rooms?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,"- **May**: The year-end settle is just a small adjustment, not a penalty. I’d rather have that than a massive upfront fee.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"- **Daisuke**: The year-end work is just one template run, not a monthly burden. I can handle that.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: I vote for Option B. Let us choose the warmth and the peace, and trust that the small year-end settle will be fair.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: I vote for Option B. Predictability is the only way to keep our friendships intact here.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: I vote for Option B. It feels the most balanced, and I hope it stops the unfairness I’ve been feeling.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,- **May**: I vote for Option B. It keeps my winter costs predictable without the heavy upfront fee.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,- **Daisuke**: I vote for Option B. One yearly check is far better than monthly work falling on me.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
